{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach and take it. Check properties, move to destination, then do specific task. Otherwise, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    />\"",
